-- words --
After Stable refuses a run on H0, hyp status prints the unstable cell with H0's first output hash, not (unknown): the example's Probe prints bad when the owner places it and ok on the next run, hyp run on H0 is refused, and hyp status of the Goal names both outputs of the cell.
-- run --
HYP_ACTOR=runner-1 HYP_ROLE=runner hyp run H0 GOAL/line-1 >/dev/null 2>&1; HYP_ACTOR=owner hyp status GOAL
-- floor: contains --
line-1/a on COMMIT: HASH then HASH
-- ceiling --
(unknown) then
